      "settings": {
        "section_id": "recipe-collab",
        "liquid": "<style>\n  .sea-collab {\n    --ink: #171717;\n    --muted: #5c5c5c;\n    --line: #e5e2dc;\n    --wash: #faf8f4;\n    --gold: #bb8f50;\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    background: var(--wash);\n    padding: 24px 28px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 20px;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    color: var(--ink);\n  }\n  .sea-collab__avatar {\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n    width: 68px;\n    height: 68px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    border: 2px solid #fff;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--gold);\n    background: #eee;\n  }\n  .sea-collab__avatar img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    object-fit: cover;\n    display: block;\n  }\n  .sea-collab__body {\n    flex: 1 1 260px;\n    min-width: 0;\n  }\n  .sea-collab__eyebrow {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    letter-spacing: .14em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--gold);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 0 0 5px;\n  }\n  .sea-collab__name {\n    font-size: 21px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    margin: 0 0 4px;\n  }\n  .sea-collab__role {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: var(--muted);\n    line-height: 1.45;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .sea-collab__cred {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: var(--muted);\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin: 10px 0 0;\n    padding-top: 10px;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);\n  }\n  .sea-collab__follow {\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    padding: 11px 20px;\n    border: 1px solid var(--ink);\n    border-radius: 999px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    background: #fff;\n    transition: background .18s ease, color .18s ease;\n  }\n  .sea-collab__follow:hover {\n    background: var(--ink);\n    color: #fff;\n  }\n  .sea-collab__follow svg {\n    width: 18px;\n    height: 18px;\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 749px) {\n    .sea-collab {\n      padding: 20px;\n      gap: 16px;\n    }\n    .sea-collab__follow {\n      width: 100%;\n      justify-content: center;\n    }\n    .sea-collab__name {\n      font-size: 19px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n{%- comment -%}\n  Disclosure: the \"Paid partner\" badge carries the 4.H material connection\n  (16 CFR Part 255). There is NO deals/fitwithsarahm.json in the context repo\n  and no mention of her anywhere in it, so the relationship is not confirmed\n  in writing - 4.H rules an unconfirmed endorsement RED and 5 records the\n  endorser register as \"Does not exist\". Disclosing is the safe default; if\n  she is not paid, remove the badge. CONFIRM BEFORE PUBLISH.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n<div class=\"sea-collab\">\n  <div class=\"sea-collab__avatar\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/fitwithsarahm.jpg?width=200\" alt=\"Sarah M\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"sea-collab__body\">\n    <p class=\"sea-collab__eyebrow\">\n      <span>Guest recipe</span>\n      <span class=\"sea-collab__badge\">Paid partner</span>\n    </p>\n    <p class=\"sea-collab__name\">Recipe by &#64;fitwithsarahm</p>\n    <p class=\"sea-collab__role\">Developed for Seatopia using <a href=\"/products/atlantic-salmon-2x-6oz-portions\" title=\"Seatopia Atlantic Salmon\">our Atlantic Salmon</a>, in 6 oz skin-off portions from Bakkafrost</p>\n    <p class=\"sea-collab__cred\">Serves 1 &middot; about 40 minutes &middot; air fryer or oven</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <a class=\"sea-collab__follow\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/fitwithsarahm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <rect x=\"2\" y=\"2\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"5\"></rect>\n      <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"></circle>\n      <circle cx=\"17.5\" cy=\"6.5\" r=\"1.2\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"></circle>\n    </svg>\n    <span>Follow</span>\n  </a>\n</div>",
