        "m_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The sauce keeps three days in the fridge, so make the full batch ahead and divide it when you cook. The cucumber is better pickled at least ten minutes before serving and holds overnight. The r&ouml;sti is the one part that will not wait &mdash; it is at its best straight out of the heat and softens within minutes, so grate, squeeze and cook it last.</p>",
