    "rich_text_standard": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "f_sub": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "The fish under the spice",
            "subheading_size": "subtitle-md",
            "secondary_color": true
          }
        },
        "f_head": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why Atlantic salmon suits a glaze like this",
            "heading_size": "title-md",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "f_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Atlantic salmon carries enough fat to stay moist under a thick, wet coating at high heat, and it flakes into broad pieces rather than shredding &mdash; which is what you want when the fish is going over r&ouml;sti in large flakes rather than being served whole. The skin-off portion is the right cut here, because the sauce needs to sit against the flesh on every side.</p><p>Ours comes from Bakkafrost in the Faroe Islands, blast-frozen to -10&deg;F at harvest and vacuum sealed. Every supplier is tested before we approve them, then randomly audited to ensure consistent compliance with the Seatopia Standard &mdash; third-party lab tested for nutrition, mercury and microplastics, and sourced from best-in-class aquaculture. Farms named, panels published.</p>",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_font": "body",
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "f_btn": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "button_label": "How we source it",
            "button_link": "/pages/why-clean-seafood-matters",
            "button_style": "secondary",
            "button_size": "md",
            "button_external": false,
            "button_icon": true
          }
        }
      },
